@startuml
!include common-theme.puml
title 模板方法模式：导入与采集流程复用统一处理骨架

abstract class AbstractImportPipeline {
  +run(source)
  #load(source)
  #validate(raw)
  #parse(raw)
  #normalize(parsed)
  #persist(data)
  #report(result)
}

class CourseFileImportPipeline
class OcrCourseImportPipeline
class CrawlerImportPipeline

AbstractImportPipeline <|-- CourseFileImportPipeline
AbstractImportPipeline <|-- OcrCourseImportPipeline
AbstractImportPipeline <|-- CrawlerImportPipeline

note right of AbstractImportPipeline
固定步骤顺序：
load -> validate -> parse -> normalize -> persist -> report
end note

CourseFileImportPipeline ..> "course_schedule"
OcrCourseImportPipeline ..> "course_schedule"
CrawlerImportPipeline ..> "activity"
@enduml
